     The aaccll__ggeett__bbrraanndd__nnpp() function returns the value 0 if successful; other‐
     wise the value -1 is returned and the global variable _e_r_r_n_o is set to in‐
     dicate the error.

EERRRROORRSS
     The aaccll__ggeett__bbrraanndd__nnpp() function fails if:

     [EINVAL]           Argument _a_c_l does not point to a valid ACL.

